Started my account on NAO 7-11-2010, and today I finally finished my
first ascension, due in no small part to the wonderful denizens of
#nethack at irc.freenode.net

Let it be noted that I am the proud victim of 2 spectacular YASDs
before this ascension took place.

I had everything going for me this particular game.  Even built my
first set of GDSM ever.  Then I made an horrific classic mistake.
Having just obtained the book of the dead, I was headed down to search
for the sanctum.  Mr. L showed up and summoned nasties, which included
a cockatrice, which was kind enough to leave its carcass behind.  I
proceeded to become a statue-maker for the next minute, then my
controlled teleportitis clicked in via RNG and I teleported to the
stairs.  But you're not supposed to go downstairs when you're
burdened, wielding a cockatrice corpse

-_-

Afterwards, another excellent start, and I was chopping Medusa into
tiny bits.  She escaped downstairs, I eventually pursued.  It was the
castle level, and she was flying around the moat.  I had levitation,
but I also had magical breathing, and it was so cool to walk around at
the bottom of a body of water.  Trouble is you can't have magic
breathing and reflection amulets on at the same time.....so I looked
deep into those gorgeous Medusa eyes and turned to
stone.............again.

But today that changed!  I even guessed wrong on the high altars, and
had to pay a visit to each of the riders before I found the one
aligned to me.  Even ascended with wishless, genocide-less and never
changed form.  Also didn't burn any amulets of life-sazing.  Finally!


